# Admin UI reference

Follow `docs/ui-references/README.md` and the screenshots in `docs/ui-references/admin/`.

Required patterns:
- Left sidebar + shipments list as primary CS view
- Status filter tabs with counts
- Search by tracking number or order number
- Row shows carrier, tracking #, status badge, latest event text + location + time
- Detail opens as a **right-hand slide-over**, not a separate page as the primary flow
- “View tracking page” opens the public customer URL
- `is_stalled` renders as a separate chip beside status, never instead of status

Do not clone TrackingMore branding; clone the interaction model.
